1 Introduction
**************

‘keymap-popup’ defines a normal Emacs keymap with embedded descriptions,
and renders it as a popup menu on demand.  One definition, two uses:
direct key dispatch and an interactive menu.

   Requires Emacs 29.1 or later (for ‘defvar-keymap’).  No external
dependencies.


