6 Special bindings
******************

Predicate quick reference:

   • ‘:if’ - _hide_ the entry (or group) when the predicate returns nil.
   • ‘:inapt-if’ - _grey out_ the entry and block its key when the
     predicate returns non-nil.

   Predicates may be evaluated repeatedly.  ‘:if’ runs during ordinary
keymap lookup as well as popup rendering; ‘:inapt-if’ runs while
rendering and handling popup keys.  Keep both cheap and free of side
effects.

